<title>USA: Pakistan to seek 500,000 T optional wheat - embassy.</title>
<headline>Pakistan to seek 500,000 T optional wheat - embassy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan in late July will seek a total of 500,000 tonnes optional origin wheat for August 11 to September 10 shipment, a Pakistan embassy official said.</p>
</text>
